The MIT license above covers the code and texts written for this repository.
It does NOT cover the following bundled third-party files; they remain under
their own licenses / with their owners:

- site/fonts/: Cinzel (Natanael Gama), Spectral (Production Type), Roboto
  Condensed (The Roboto Condensed Project Authors) and Cormorant SC (Christian
  Thalmann) - SIL Open Font License 1.1, see site/fonts/OFL.txt.
- Game artwork and data of Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War II - Retribution
  (Relic Entertainment / SEGA, Games Workshop): site/assets/ (map, hero, race
  and squad images), site/img/race_*.png, stats/static/icons/, the game data
  tables replay/item_tables.json and replay/maps_points.json, and the
  game-related imagery in the launcher screenshots site/img/launcher*.png.
  Used for identification of in-game content only; no rights are granted.
- Relic's public CA certificate: lobby/relic_ca.pem, tools/relicscan/relic_ca.pem.
- gameserver/tests/data/ (*.bin, *.jsonl.gz): recorded game network traffic,
  used as test fixtures only.
- stats/static/*.zip: older builds of our own add-ons (LobbyStats, FrameProbe)
  from dow2-launcher/Dow2-patches, under that repository's license.
